# Fair baseline for the v1.2.7 trial, matched to the live serve's shape.
# Nov 11 ~2 PM PST, SparkOne: MemAvailable 6.96-6.98 GiB, 1.23 GiB truly free,
# headroom about 2-3 GiB. SparkTwo MemAvailable 8.59 GiB.
# Live prompt cache: 512 MiB, 121 evictions, 95.2% prefix hit rate, avg TTFT 1.77 s.
# Residency 0.5 GiB is that cache's order of magnitude. Prefill stays full.
# Do not set TENSORFOLD_MEMORY_RESERVE_GIB below 12.2. Omitting it keeps the
# engine default (unified memory: at least 4 GiB, else total/10, about 12.8 GiB
# on a 128 GiB Spark). Setting 12.2 would lower that default.
# Do not set TF_DSV41_POOL_TOKENS. Do not set TF_DSV41_PIECES_FLOOR.
# CONTEXT stays 524288. 655360 killed a 464K-token turn. Never 1048576.
CONTEXT=524288
PARALLEL=4
TF_DSV41_CONTEXT=524288
TF_DSV41_PREFILL=full
TF_DSV41_SESSION_RESIDENT_GIB=0.5
